 immune mechanisms in the pathogenesis of cardiomyopathy &#x02013; role of viruses, cytokines, and nitric oxide</article-title><source>Jpn Circ</source><year>1997</year><volume>61</volume><fpage>275</fpage><lpage>91</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="b25"><label>25</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Feldman</surname><given-names>AM</given-names></name><name><surname>McNamara</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Myocarditis</article-title><source>N Engl J Med</source><year>2000</year><volume>343</volume><fpage>1388</fpage><lpage>98</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11070105</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b26"><label>26</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Morelli</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Dianzani</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Sgreccia</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><article-title>Reversible acute global left ventricular dysfunction in a patient with autosomal recessive dystrophic epidermolysis bullosa</article-title><source>Int J Cardiol</source><year>2001</year><volume>79</volume><fpage>321</fpage><lpage>3</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11488288</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b27"><label>27</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Fett</surname><given-names>JD</given-names></name><name><surname>Ansari</surname><given-names>AA</given-names></name><name><surname>Sundstrom</surname><given-names>JB</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><article-title>Peripartum cardiomyopathy: a selenium disconnection and an autoimmune connection</article-title><source>Int J Cardiol</source><year>2002</year><volume>86</volume><fpage>311</fpage><lpage>16</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12419571</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b28"><label>28</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Brook</surname><given-names>MM</given-names></name><name><surname>Weinhouse</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Jarenwattananon</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><article-title>Dilated cardiomyopathy complicating a case of epidermolysis bullosa dystrophica</article-title><source>Pediatr Dermatol</source><year>1989</year><volume>6</volume><fpage>21</fpage><lpage>3</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">2704658</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b29"><label>29</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Zales</surname><given-names>VR</given-names></name><name><surname>Benson</surname><given-names>DW Jr</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Reversible cardiomyopathy due to carnitine deficiency from renal tubular wasting</article-title><source>Pediatr Cardiol</source><year>1995</year><volume>16</volume><fpage>76</fpage><lpage>8</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">7784239</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b30"><label>30</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Kay</surname><given-names>JD</given-names></name><name><surname>Colan</surname><given-names>SD</given-names></name><name><surname>Graham</surname><given-names>TP Jr</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Congestive heart failure in pediatric patients</article-title><source>Am Heart J</source><year>2001</year><volume>142</volume><fpage>923</fpage><lpage>8</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11685182</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b31"><label>31</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Nugent</surname><given-names>AW</given-names></name><name><surname>Daubeney</surname><given-names>PEF</given-names></name><name><surname>Chondros</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><article-title>The epidemiology of childhood cardiomyopathy in Australia</article-title><source>N Engl J Med</source><year>2003</year><volume>348</volume><fpage>1639</fpage><lpage>46</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12711738</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b32"><label>32</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Lipshultz</surname><given-names>SE</given-names></name><name><surname>Sleeper</surname><given-names>LA</given-names></name><name><surname>Towbin</surname><given-names>JA</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><article-title>The incidence of pediatric cardiomyopathy in two regions of the United States</article-title><source>N Engl J Med</source><year>2003</year><volume>348</volume><fpage>1647</fpage><lpage>55</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12711739</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>